2 CONT This page, and all contents, are Copyright © 1995 by John P. DuLong and associates, Berkley, MI. Created 23 November 1995. Modified 12 May 2016. The heraldry art work on this web page was accomplished using Adobe Illustrator CS an
2 CONC d Armorial Gold Heraldry Clipart ver. 15.4.
