2 CONT Tanguay Vol I pg 381. (This is very confusing information including: his name as Mathieu Michel and his spouse as Jeanne LeMarchand which are also shown in other sources as the name of his parents.  Jette does state that his daugh
2 CONC ter, Anne, was born out of wedlock.  Anne is listed in Tanguay as his daughter with Jeanne LeMarchand as the mother).
