2 CONT The family of Jacques LENEUF and Marguerite LEGARDEUR de REPENTIGNY
2 CONT
2 CONT LENEUF, Jacques (Mathieu & Jeanne LEMARCHAND,  sieur de La Poterie, born about 1606 (cemsus 1666) Caen (Calvados), France
2 CONT * married about 1630, from Thury-Harcourt (Calvados, France
2 CONT
2 CONT LEGARDEUR de REPENTIGNY, Marguerite (René LEGARDEUR du TILLY & Catherine de CORDAY, born about 1608 (census 1666) Thury-Harcourt (Calvados, France
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Marie Anne or Marie, born about 1632 (census 1681) Thury-Harcourt (Calvados), France, marriage contract 1652-10-21 (depositary Sévérin Ameau) René ROBINEAU de BÉCANCOUR and de PORTNEUF
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) Marie Catherine, born about 1640 (census 1666), 1637 (buried 1697) Thury-Harcourt (Calvados), France, buried 1697-10-25 Québec (Qc), married Québec (Qc) 1655-08-23 Pierre DENIS de LARONDE
2 CONT
2 CONT 3) Michel, seigneur de Lavallière and de Beaubassin, governor of Acadie (1683-1684) (gouverneur de l'Acadie (1683-1684)), married about 1666 Marie or Marguerite DENIS, married La Rochelle (Saint-Barthélemy) (Charente-Maritime), Fr
2 CONC ance 1687-06-01 Françoise DENIS
