2 CONT Jean Leneuf 1 (1530 - 1599)
2 CONT
2 CONT Also know2n as Jean le Neuf de la Poterie 2.
2 CONT
2 CONT Born between 1530 and 1544 1. He was the bourgeois of Saint-Sauveur de Thury, Calvados, France 1. He married Marguerite Legardeur about
2 CONT 1566 1. He died before 28 November 1599 1.
2 CONT
2 CONT List  of known children:
2 CONT
