2 CONT
2 CONT Here the family of Antoine DESROSIERS and Anne LENEUF of the HERISSON!
2 CONT
2 CONT DESROSIERS, Antoine (Antoine & Sylvie) , Baptized 1617-04-14 Renaison. (The Loire), France, Deceased 1691-08-08, Buried 1691-08-09 Champlain (Quebec)
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married 1647 Renaison  (The Loire:), France, marriage contract 1647-11-24 (Notary Boujonnier)
2 CONT
2 CONT LENEUF of the HERISSON, Anne (Michel LENEUF &.., according to DGFQ 348, born about 1632 (census-1666, Sép-1702) Caen (Calvados:), France, buried 1702-12-05 Quebec (Quebec)
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Anne , born 1661-11-12, baptized 1661-11-12 Three-Rivers (Quebec), died 1731-02-23, buried 1731-02-24 Champlain (Quebec), marriage contract 1674-04-04 heading 1674-04-14 (notary Guillaume Larue) Jacques TURCOT , married Champla
2 CONC in (Quebec) 1702-04-24 Jean Baptiste DEBIDABÉ aka TROISVILLE
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) Antoine , born 1664-08-30, baptized 1664-08-30 Three-Rivers (Quebec), deceased between 1737-06-17 and 1742-01 Berthierville (Quebec), married Champlain (Quebec) 1696-11-26 Marie Renee LEPELLÉ
2 CONT
2 CONT 3) Jean , Married Champlain (Quebec) 1682-01-20 Marie Francoise Perrine DANDONNEAU
2 CONT
2 CONT 4) Marie , Baptized 1650-06-16 Three-Rivers (Quebec), Died After 1711-02-18, Married Three-Rivers (Quebec) 1664-02-19 Alexandre RAUX
2 CONT
2 CONT 5) Marie Jeanne , born about 1671 (rec-1681, conf-1681), 1673 (m-1687), deceased after 1744-08-28, married Champlain (Quebec) 1687-03-18 Claude DROUET of RICHARVILLE
2 CONT
2 CONT 6) Michel , marriage contract  under private signature 1679-01-14 (notary Antoine Adhémar) Marie Thomas ARTAULT
2 CONT
2 CONT 7) Pierre , Married Champlain (Quebec) 1693-04-27 Marguerite AUBUCHON
2 CONT
