1 NOTE <http://www.sylvestre.qc.ca/0000337.htm> shows the following: "MARIE-JEANNE, was baptised at Trois-Rivières in 1659. On 18 mars 1687, she married Claude Drauet."
2 CONT Married 18 Mar 1687 Claude Drouet (son of Claude & Appolline Soisson, bap. 1657) at Champlain, Quebec, Canada; sources: (c. 27 Aug 1688 de Meromnsont); family (11 children) listed in Jette pg 362 Tanguay Vol I pg 201 shows family 
2 CONC of 7 children; Tanguay Vol I pg 192.
2 CONT Ancestry.com download named 28817.ged (copy filed 29-2).
2 CONT Database of Gilles C. Paquette from the internet (copy filed 29-2).
2 CONT "The Grand Families" from the internet (copy filed 29-2).
2 CONT Jette pg 348.
2 CONT <www.my.ged.com>  "The Turcotte/Pratte Family Tree" (copy filed 2-16).
2 CONT ------------------------------------------------
2 CONT The following was acquired from:  <http://francogene.com/quebec-genealogy/005/242.php>.
2 CONT
2 CONT The family of Claude DROUET de RICHARVILLE and Marie Jeanne DESROSIERS de RICHARVILLE
2 CONT
2 CONT DROUET de RICHARVILLE, Claude (Claude DROUET & Apolline SOIXSON), born 1665-10-17, baptized Dourdan (St-Germain) (Essonne: 910200), France, died after 1748-05-13
2 CONT * married 1687-03-18 Champlain (Québec), marriage contract 1688-08-27 (notary Louis de Merommont)
2 CONT
2 CONT DESROSIERS de RICHARVILLE, Marie Jeanne (Antoine DESROSIERS & Anne LENEUF du HERISSON [156]), born about 1671, 1673 (m-1687), died after 1744-08-28
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Armand or Hermann, married Sorel (Québec) 1721-05-26 Catherine Charlotte LAMY aka DEFOND
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) Claude, married Montréal (Québec) 1747-05-08 Marguerite de COUAGNE
2 CONT
2 CONT 3) Denis Didier, married Sorel (Québec) 1718-10-09 Jeanne Michelle LEMATRE
2 CONT
2 CONT 4) François Antoine, married Kaskaskia (Illinois) 1756-02-03 Françoise OUTLAS or HOUTLAS or OUTELAS
2 CONT
2 CONT 5) Geneviève, born about 1711, died 1749-12-24, buried 1749-12-25 Québec (Québec), marriage contract 1738-02-10 (notary Antoine Puypéroux de Lafosse) Vital DUPONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 6) Joseph Antoine, married Sorel (Québec) 1728-05-19 Marie LAMY aka DEFOND
2 CONT
2 CONT 7) Marie Josèphe, married Sorel (Québec) 1718-12-07 Louis Adrien DANDONNEAU aka DUSABLÉ
2 CONT
2 CONT More information about this family
2 CONT
2 CONT Source(s) or reference(s) : Bulletin des recherches historiques; Programme de recherches en démographie historique de l'Université de Montréal (PRDH-RAB); La population des forts français d'Amérique; History.
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------
