1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LLQR-GQN
2 CONT Brief Life History of Madeleine'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Madeleine Desrosiers was born on 27 May 1704, in Champlain, Francheville, Quebec, Canada, her father, Antoine DesRosiers, was 39 and her mother, Marie Renée Lepellé, was 25. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Louis Lefebvre (1694- ) on 23 January 1740, in Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 2 daughters. 
2 CONT Marie Anne Belisle 1741–1779
2 CONT Marie Madeleine Belisle 1742–1742
2 CONT Joseph Bélisle 1743–1746
2 CONT
2 CONT She married 2nd husband Joseph Pothier (1719–1798)
2 CONT on 9 October 1747 in Trois-Rivières, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT No children on record.
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 14 May 1782, in Trois-Rivières, Canada, New France, at the age of 77, and was buried in Trois-Rivières, Canada, New France.
