1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LCJ1-HR1
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Louise Marguerite'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Louise Marguerite Desrosiers was born about July 1700, in Trois-Rivières, Canada, New France, her father, Pierre Desrosiers, was 33 and her mother, Marguerite Aubuchon, was 30. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Honoré Georgeteau on 26 January 1723, in Bécancour, Trois-Rivières, Canada, New France. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 2 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT After Honore's death in 1755, she married 2nd husband Joseph Joyal Perrault (27 years her junior) on 9 January 1756 in Rivière-du-Loup, Canada, New France.
2 CONT They had no children on record.
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in September 1784, in Rivière-du-Loup, Quebec, British North America, at the age of 84, and was buried in Rivière-du-Loup, Quebec, British North America.
2 CONT
2 CONT
