1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/K4LL-5LV
2 CONT Brief Life History of Michel'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Michel Desmarais was born on 1 August 1724, in Trois-Rivières, Quebec, Canada, his father, Antoine Lepellé Desmarais, was 55 and his mother, Barbe Godefroy, was 46. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 1st wife Marie Josephe Jahan Laviolette (1731-1761) on 1 October 1753, in District Judiciaire de Trois-Rivières, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 3 daughters. 
2 CONT Josephe Lepellé dit Desmarais 1754–1819
2 CONT Antoinette Lepellé dit Desmarais 1756–1763
2 CONT Michel Lepellé dit Desmarais II 1757–1769
2 CONT Jean Baptiste Lepellé dit Desmarais 1758–1760
2 CONT Louise Desmarais 1759–
2 CONT Male Child Desmarais 1760–1760
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 2nd wife Francoise Michaud (1740–1794) on 17 mai 1763
2 CONT at Immaculée Conception, Trois-Rivières, Trois-Rivières, Canada, Nouvelle-France
2 CONT Joseph Lepelle dit Desmarais 1764–1827
2 CONT Louis Lepelle dit Desmarais 1766–1840
2 CONT Nicolas Lepelle dit Desmarais 1768–1812
2 CONT Michel Lepelle Desmarais Angers 1774–1835
2 CONT Marie Theotiste Lepelle dit Desmarais 1776–
2 CONT Francois Lepelle dit Desmarais 1777–1849
2 CONT Antoine Lepelle dit Desmarais 1780–
2 CONT Marie Angelique Lepelle dit Desmarais 1781–
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 14 September 1796, in Berthierville, Berthier, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 72, and was buried in Sainte-Geneviève-de-Berthier, Berthier, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT --------------------------
