1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LY4S-TRV
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Joseph'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Joseph Cottenoir de Préville was born on 21 July 1727, in Berthier, Quebec, Canada, her father, Antoine Cotnoir, was 38 and her mother, Catherine Josephte Desrosiers dit Dutremble, was 26. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Joseph Beaufort (1735-1797) on 11 February 1760, in Berthier, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 7 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was buried in Saint-Cuthbert, Berthier, Quebec, Canada.
