1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/PMLH-KMP
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marguerite'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marguerite Cottenoire Préville was born on 28 March 1736, in Île Dupas, D'Autray, Quebec, Canada, her father, Antoine Cotnoir, was 47 and her mother, Catherine Josephte Desrosiers dit Dutremble, was 35. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Pierre Duteau Vilandre on 14 July 1760, in Berthier, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 7 sons and 2 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 8 December 1817, in Saint-Cuthbert, D'Autray, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 81, and was buried in Quebec, Quebec, Canada.
