1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LHDB-BWT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Anne'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Anne Belisle was born on 4 January 1741, in Trois-Rivières, Quebec, Canada, her father, Louis Lefebvre, was 46 and her mother, Madeleine Desrosiers, was 36. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Louis Pothier on 28 January 1754, in Trois-Rivières, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 9 sons and 5 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 20 October 1779, in her hometown, at the age of 38, and was buried in Trois-Rivières, Canada, New France.
