1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/L4J9-J23
2 CONT Brief Life History of Agathe'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Agathe Desrosiers was born on 25 November 1755, in Berthierville, Berthier, Quebec, Canada, her father, Alexis Desrosiers dit Lafrenière, was 40 and her mother, Marie Agathe Bigot, was 31. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married 1st husband Pierre Joseph Généreux (1740–1764) circa 1776
2 CONT They had at least 8 children:
2 CONT Pierre Généreux 1778–
2 CONT Marie Anne Généreux 1778–
2 CONT Marie Josephte Généreux 1780–1844
2 CONT Joseph Généreux 1781–1782
2 CONT Agathe Généreux 1783–
2 CONT Baby male Généreux 1785–
2 CONT Marie Louise Généreux 1787–1820
2 CONT Pélagie Louise Généreux 1790–1863
2 CONT
2 CONT She married 2nd husband Jean Baptiste Baillargeon (1739-1800) in 1796, in Sainte-Geneviève-de-Berthier, Berthier, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 1 daughter. 
2 CONT Marie Genevieve Baillargeon dit Beaucage 1798-1850
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 7 April 1812, in her hometown, at the age of 56.
