1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/KC3B-N99
2 CONT Brief Life History of Josephe'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Josephe Lepellé dit Desmarais was born on 29 October 1754, in District Judiciaire de Trois-Rivières, Quebec, Canada, her father, Michel Desmarais, was 30 and her mother, Marie Josephe Jahan Laviolette, was 23. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Louis Lemaitre Auger Duhaime on 9 August 1774, in Louiseville, Maskinongé, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 2 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 18 September 1819, in Maskinongé, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 64, and was buried in Louiseville, Maskinongé, Quebec, Canada.
