2 CONT Brief Life History of Michel'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Michel Lepelle  Desmarais II was born on 19 May 1774, in Saint-Cuthbert, Berthier, Quebec, Canada, his father, Michel Desmarais, was 49 and his mother, Francoise Michaud, was 33. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Genevieve Genereux on 1 September 1823, in Sainte-Élisabeth, Joliette, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 1 daughter. 
2 CONT Michel Desmarais III 1824–
2 CONT Marie Adeline Desmarais 1829–1888
2 CONT Théophile Desmarais 1835–1911
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 29 November 1835, in Sainte-Mélanie, Joliette, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 61, and was buried in Sainte-Mélanie, Joliette, Quebec, Canada.
