2 CONT When Louis Lepelle dit Desmarais was born about 1766, in Quebec, Canada, his father, Michel Desmarais, was 43 and his mother, Francoise Michaud, was 27. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Rosalie Ethier on 18 July 1803, in Sainte-Geneviève-de-Berthier, Berthier, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 5 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 17 March 1840, in Lanoraie, Berthier, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 75, and was buried in Saint-Joseph-de-Lanoraie, Berthier, Quebec, Canada.
