1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LCRX-T7G
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Agathe'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Agathe Bigot was born on 4 April 1724, in Champlain, Trois-Rivières, Canada, New France, her father, Michel Bigot, was 33 and her mother, Marie Anne Toutant, was 28. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Alexis Desrosiers dit Lafrenière on 30 January 1742, in Champlain, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 3 daughters. 
2 CONT Agathe Desrosiers 1746–1750
2 CONT Alexis Desrosiers Lafreniere 1746–1820
2 CONT Michel Desrosiers 1749–1789
2 CONT Guillaume Desrosiers Lafreniere 1750–1829
2 CONT Joseph Desrosiers Lafrenière 1751–
2 CONT Louise Desrosiers 1752–1753
2 CONT Agathe Desrosiers 1755–1812
2 CONT François Marie Desrosiers 1759–1777
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 15 October 1787, in Berthierville, Berthier, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 63, and was buried in Berthierville, Berthier, Quebec, Canada.
