2 CONT Parents
2 CONT Pierre DUBOIS 1695-1750
2 CONT Franoise-Thrse RIVARD 1703-1741
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/K194-NCH
2 CONT Brief Life History of Geneviève'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Geneviève Dubois was born on 10 January 1739, in Champlain, Francheville, Quebec, Canada, her father, Pierre Dubois, was 43 and her mother, Marie Francoise-Therese Rivard, was 35. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Francois Blais on 10 February 1755, in Champlain, Les Chenaux, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 11 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 12 March 1808, in Quebec, Canada, at the age of 69.
