1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/MRPN-VXN
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Josette'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Josephte/Josette Beaufort was born on 1 October 1764, in Berthier, Quebec, Canada, her father, joseph Beaufort, was 29 and her mother, Marie Joseph Cottenoir de préville, was 37. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Alexis Duteau Vilandre on 18 August 1783. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 2 daughters.
2 CONT Alexis Duteau Vilandre (1) 1784– (before 1792) died in infancy
2 CONT Francois Duteau Vilandre 1788–1788
2 CONT Joseph Duteau 1790–1866
2 CONT Alexis Duteau Vilandre (2) 1792–1792 died in infancy
2 CONT Marie Dutaut-Vilandre 1795–1815
2 CONT Charlotte Duteau 1796–
2 CONT Alexis Duteau (3) 1799–1799 died in infancy
