2 CONT Brief Life History of Joseph'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Joseph Duteau Vilandre was born on 18 March 1764, in Île Dupas, D'Autray, Quebec, Canada, his father, Pierre Duteau Vilandre, was 44 and his mother, Marguerite Cottenoire Préville, was 27. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marguerite Dupuis on 19 June 1786, in Île Dupas, D'Autray, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 5 daughters. 
2 CONT Joseph Duteau-Vilandre 1787–
2 CONT Pierre Duteau Vilandre 1788–
2 CONT Marguerite Duteau Vilandre 1790–1871
2 CONT Marie Madeleine Duteau Vilandre 1792–
2 CONT Françoise Duteau Vilandre 1795–
2 CONT Genevieve Duteau Vilandre 1796–1871
2 CONT Alexis Dutaut Vilandré 1797–
2 CONT Élisabeth Duteau Vilandre 1799–
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 7 March 1866, in Saint-Cuthbert, D'Autray, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 101.
