1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LHT2-TMP
2 CONT Brief Life History of Élizabeth
2 CONT
2 CONT When Élizabeth Lavallée was born on 13 August 1778, in Berthierville, Berthier, Quebec, Canada, her father, Pierre Lavallée, was 37 and her mother, Marie-Joseph Auré dit Laferrière, was 31.
2 CONT
2 CONT  She married Jean-Baptiste Boucher on 4 July 1796, in Sainte-Geneviève-de-Berthier, Berthier, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 8 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 18 March 1857, in Saint-Thomas, Joliette, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 78, and was buried in Saint-Thomas, Joliette, Quebec, Canada.
