1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/KGBP-QS7
2 CONT Brief Life History of Cécile'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Cécile Desrosiers- Lafrenière was born on 16 February 1777, in Berthierville, Berthier, Quebec, Canada, her father, Guillaume Desrosiers Lafreniere, was 28 and her mother, Marie Josephte Laferrière, was 21. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Joseph Prévost on 5 February 1798, in Sainte-Geneviève-de-Berthier, Berthier, Canada East, British North America. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 1 daughter.
2 CONT Joseph Provost II 1798–
2 CONT Marguerite Provost 1801–
2 CONT
2 CONT Following the death of Joseph in 1801 (1 month after the birth of their daughter), Cecile married 2nd husband  
2 CONT Francois Chevalier Perigord (1767–1832) on 2/23/1802 in  Sainte-Geneviève-de-Berthier, Berthier, Québec, Canada. They had 2 sons and 2 daughters:
2 CONT François Chevalier- Périgord 1803–1803
2 CONT Marie- Julienne Chevalier- Périgord 1804–
2 CONT Jean Baptiste Chevalier- Périgard 1805–1857
2 CONT Marie- Anne Chevalier- Périgord 1809–1816
