2 CONT Brief Life History of Gabriel'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Gabriel Lefebvre Descoteaux was born on 27 March 1760, in Bécancour, Quebec, Canada, his father, Ange Gabriel Lefebvre dit Descôteaux, was 32 and his mother, Marie Madeleine Desrosiers, was 34. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marguerite Lemire on 14 November 1786, in Saint Antoine de la Baie du Febvre, Yamaska, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 6 sons. 
2 CONT Gabriel Lefebvre 1788–1857
2 CONT Joseph Lefebvre Descoteaux 1791–
2 CONT Charles Lefebvre 1793–
2 CONT Jean Baptiste Lefebvre 1796–1865
2 CONT Louis Lefebvre Descoteaux 1798–1849
2 CONT Antoine Lefebvre dit Descoteaux 1800–1849
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 1 May 1800, in Saint Antoine de la Baie du Febvre, Yamaska, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 40, and was buried in Saint-Antoine-de-la-Baie-du-Febvre, Yamaska, Quebec, Canada.
