1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =From [http://www.nosorigines.qc.ca/GenealogieQuebec.aspx?genealogy=Francois_Laronde&pid=649336&lng=en Genealogy of Canada]=
2 CONT Un François de La Ronde, conjoint de Marie Anne Kichiabanokwe, est décédé avant août 1817. S’il était le fils de Louis Marie (1172363), l’époux de Geneviève Jeanne Sagala serait François Wabechkipinesi, fils de Charles François (6
2 CONC 23252). Reference: Mariages de la Paroisse de St-Joachim de Pointe Claire
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Although most records available indicate that he was the son of Charles Francois Denys de la Ronde 9 June 1763 at Sandwich Mission, Windsor or Detroit, and died 19 Feb 1840 at Penetanguishene, Ontario, Canada
2 CONT  and his  wife, Magdeleine Pewadjiwonokwe born 1778 in the Lake Huron and Lake Simcoe area, Ontario, Canada...  no solid documentation of his parents have yet to be discovered. Although another son,  Michael has records indicating
2 CONC  that he was a brother who attended his wedding, there is no type of authentic parental records yet available...
