2 DATE 12 NOV 1822
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/9JBS-99J
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie-Josephte Claire'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie-Josephte Claire Baby was born on 12 August 1755, in Saint-François, Trois-Rivières, Canada, New France, her father, Jacques Dupéron Bâby, was 24 and her mother, Marie Angelique Crevier, was 22. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Jean-Baptiste Proulx on 24 October 1774, in Saint-François-du-Lac, Odanak, Nicolet-Yamaska, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT Marie Josephte Proulx 1777–1777
2 CONT Marie Madeleine Proulx 1778–1778
2 CONT Marie Josephte Proulx 1778–1778
2 CONT Jean-Baptiste Proulx 1779–1836
2 CONT Madeleine Proulx 1786–1830
2 CONT Raphaël Proulx 1789–1858
2 CONT Joseph PROULX 1792–1792
2 CONT Pierre PROULX 1794–
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 12 November 1822, in Nicolet, Nicolet-Yamaska, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 67, and was buried in Nicolet, Nicolet-Yamaska, Quebec, Canada.
