1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LHQT-RNJ
2 CONT Brief Life History of Louis
2 CONT
2 CONT When Louis Blais was born in 1778, in Berthier, Quebec, Canada, his father, Francois Blais, was 42 and his mother, Geneviève Dubois, was 39.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 1st wife Genevieve Leveille (1772-1808) on 7 January 1801, in Berthierville, Berthier, Quebec, Canada. 
2 CONT
2 CONT After the death of Genevieve in 1808, he married 2nd wife Françoise Audet dit Lapointe (1786–1828)
2 CONT on 22 Août [August]1808 in Saint-Cuthbert, Berthier, Québec, Canada
2 CONT They had 9 children.
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 19 December 1830, in Saint-Cuthbert, Berthier, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 52.
2 CONT
