2 CONT Biography
2 CONT Appoline Ruais was born on 7 March 1788 to Jean Ruel and Marie Rosalie Gagnon at Rimouski, Québec, Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT She passed away on 7 April 1868.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
