2 CONT
2 CONT When Paul Godin was born on 4 September 1778, in Quebec, Canada, his father, Antoine Godin, was 28 and his mother, Marie Anne Richard, was 29. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Françoise Godin on 20 February 1810, in Cap-Santé, Portneuf, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 5 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 3 December 1831, in Cap-Santé, Portneuf, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 53, and was buried in Cap-Santé, Portneuf, Quebec, Canada.
