1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/9KGN-1CZ
2 CONT Brief Life History of François'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When François Rivard dit Lavigne was born on 19 December 1783, in Saint-Pierre-les-Becquets, Buckingham, Lower Canada, British North America, his father, François Rivard Lavigne, was 28 and his mother, Marie Elisabeth Laliberté, w
2 CONC as 21. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Bourbeau on 7 October 1806, in Nativite de Becancour, Bécancour, Buckingham, Lower Canada, British North America. They were the parents of at least 10 sons and 9 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 13 August 1862, in Gentilly, Nicolet, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 78, and was buried in Gentilly Ancient R.C. Cemetery (2nd), Gentilly, Bécancour, Nicolet, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT --------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.nosorigines.qc.ca/GenealogieQuebec.aspx?genealogie=Francois_Lavigne&pid=771535&lng=fr
