3 CONT M
3 CONT de Alexis Tellier et Magdeleine Moraux
3 CONT The 10 January 1803 after the publication of three bans of marriage made from the pulpit of the parish mass, similar publication made at Berthier as attested by the certification of ___ ___ registered this day between Alexis Telli
3 CONC er adult of the Parish of Berthier, son of Joseph Tellier an of ___  Monique Barar, and Magdeline Moraux minor daughter of Antoine Moraux and of Magdeline Casobon of this parish with the consent of their parents and not having fou
3 CONC nd any impeachment to said marriage I undersigned have received their mutuel consent and given them the nuptial benediction following ___ of the Ste-Church and that in presence of Joseph Tellier father of the groom, Alexis Tellier
3 CONC , his paternal uncle, Antoine Moraux father of the bride, Antoint Moraux her brother, Jean-Baptiste Casobon her maternal uncle who together with the spouses did not sign below.
