2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT Antoine was born about 1813. 
2 CONT He married Marguerite Gonneville at St. François Xavier on 10 Jan 1837≤ref>"Canada, Manitoba Church Records, 1800-1959," database with images, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3QSQ-G994-WL4Z?cc=1992433&wc=M6PR
2 CONC -MPD%3A325478101%2C325478102%2C325478103 : 27 April 2021), St François Xavier Municipality: St François Xavier > Catholic St François Xavier de la Prairie duCheval Blanc > Baptisms, marriages, burials 1834-1844 vol 1 > image 34 of
2 CONC  100, Record M25; Provincial Archives of Manitoba, Winnipeg. ''select information extracted and translated by [[Mutter-136|Dale Mutter]]''≤/ref>: ''The tenth of January 1837, marriage between Antoine Lafreniere, of-age son of Anto
2 CONC ine Lafreniere and Marie Versaille of this parish, and Marguerite Gonneville, minor daughter of Antoine Gonneville and Marguerite La(?), father and mother also of this parish; in the presence of Andre Trottier and Abraham Martin.'
2 CONC '
2 CONT Antoine Lafreniere, widowed of the late Marie Wells, and Marie Bouvierwere married on 17 Nov 1851 at St. François Xavier, La Prairie du Cheval Blanc, Red River Colony, Rupert's Land, British North America.≤ref name=marbou>Manitoba
2 CONC , Canada, Baptisms, Marriages, and Burials, 1834-1959 Catholic Records: St François Xavier, Vol 1-2 1834-1854, Vol 3-4 1854-1873, Vol 5-5B 1874-1878, image 174 of 900 at [https://www.ancestry.com/interactive/61513/FS_005472546_001
2 CONC 73/90011394 Ancestry.com (paid)]≤/ref>
2 CONT Antoine Lafreniere, widowed of the late Marie Bouvier, and Ursule Morand were married on 19 Sep 1854 at St. François Xavier, La Prairie du Cheval Blanc, Red River Colony, Rupert's Land, British North America.≤ref name=marmor>Manit
2 CONC oba, Canada, Baptisms, Marriages, and Burials, 1834-1959 for Antoine Lafrenière Catholic Records: St François Xavier, Vol 1-2 1834-1854, Vol 3-4 1854-1873, Vol 5-5B 1874-1878, image 217 of 900 at [https://www.ancestry.com/interact
2 CONC ive/61513/FS_005472546_00217/11668 Ancestry.com (paid)]≤/ref>
2 CONT Antoine Lafreniere, the husband of Ursule Marand, died on 14 Oct 1874 and was buried on 16 Oct 1874 in the cemetery of St. François Xavier,Manitoba, Canada.≤ref name=sepul>Manitoba, Canada, Baptisms, Marriages, and Burials, 1834-1
2 CONC 959 Catholic Records: St François Xavier, Vol 1-2 1834-1854, Vol 3-4 1854-1873, Vol 5-5B 1874-1878, image 584 of 900 at [https://www.ancestry.com/interactive/61513/FS_005472546_00584?pid=14742 Ancestry.com (paid)]≤/ref>
