2 CONT Brief Life History of Hyppolite
2 CONT
2 CONT When Hyppolite Desrosiers-Lafrenière was born on 27 April 1823, in Berthierville, Berthier, Quebec, Canada, his father, Jean Baptiste Lafreniére, was 37 and his mother, Anne Rosalie Fuseau Roch, was 28. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Louise Lavallée on 29 September 1857, in Berthierville, Berthier, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 13 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He lived in Saint-Norbert, Berthier, Quebec, Canada in 1881. He died in Quebec, Quebec, Canada.
