1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/131880459/angeline-marie-terrio
2 CONT
2 CONT Angeline Marie St George Terrio
2 CONT BIRTH
2 CONT 13 Nov 1824
2 CONT Quebec, Canada
2 CONT DEATH
2 CONT 10 Dec 1922 (aged 98)
2 CONT Waupaca, Waupaca County, Wisconsin, USA
2 CONT BURIAL
2 CONT Sacred Heart Catholic Cemetery
2 CONT Manawa, Waupaca County, Wisconsin, USA  Show Map
2 CONT MEMORIAL ID
2 CONT 131880459 · View Source
2 CONT MEMORIAL
2 CONT PHOTOS 1
2 CONT FLOWERS 2
2 CONT Married: October 27, 1846, Montreal, Quebec, Canada
2 CONT
2 CONT Angeline Terrio was born in Quebec, Canada November 13, 1824 where her early life was passed and died at the home of her son J.A. (Joseph Andrew) Terrio of Waupaca, Tues. December 20, 1922 in her ninety-eighth year.
2 CONT She moved with her parents to New York State and was there married to John Terrio where they moved to Vermont and later a farm near Manawa, Wis. Where they spent the greater part of their life until death called her husband May 2,
2 CONC  1890. Since that time she made her home with her children. She was the mother of eight children five of whom are living. Lewis, Darby, Mont.; George, Forest Lake, Mich; Eliza (Mrs. McKenzie), Clintonville; and Joseph of Waupaca. 
2 CONC John the eldest died Sept. 1920 and was buried in Weyauwega where he had resided for many years. Mary died in infancy, Julia (Mrs. John Beach) of Virginia, Minn. Died in 1905.
2 CONT Of the deceased it may be said that her life was one of usefulness. She was reared in the Catholic Faith and faithfully lived it.
2 CONT Funeral services were held at the Manawa Church and interment in the Manawa Catholic Church.
2 CONT
2 CONT Bio by: Deb Bernard
2 CONT
