1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/KPHG-NPQ
2 CONT Brief Life History of Antoine'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Antoine Hamel was born on 19 August 1796, in Baie-du-Febvre, Nicolet-Yamaska, Quebec, Canada, his father, Michel Hamel, was 43 and his mother, Marie Angelique Caya, was 39. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Angelique Marot dit Labonte on 4 October 1819, in Saint-Antoine-de-la-Baie-du-Febvre, Yamaska, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 13 sons and 11 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 26 December 1885, in Saint-Bonaventure, Drummond, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 89, and was buried in Saint Francois de Sales de Neuville, Portneuf, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT
