1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Although the St. Francis Xavier Church Records clearly list him as Guillaume, there is significant evidence that he was known as William Richardville throughout most of his life. Also, I've seen quite a few family 
2 CONC trees which list his date of baptism as his birth date. He was born, 1/16/1830 and baptized on 3/14/1830. This is directly from St. Francis-Xavier Church records (baptisms), 1749-1838.  
