1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/K2F4-ZBX
2 CONT Brief Life History of Louis'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Louis Blais was born on 6 February 1813, in Sainte-Geneviève-de-Berthier, Berthier, Quebec, Canada, his father, Louis Blais, was 35 and his mother, Françoise Audet dit Lapointe, was 26. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Emélie Lippe on 30 May 1837, in Lanoraie, D'Autray, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He lived in Berthierville, D'Autray, Quebec, Canada in 1881.
