1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/M1GB-RY9
2 CONT Brief Life History of Modeste'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Modeste Cinq-Mars-Guillet was born on 10 January 1797, in Saint-François-Xavier-de-Batiscan, Les Chenaux, Quebec, Canada, his father, Joseph Louis Guillet-St Marc, was 37 and his mother, Brigitte L'Heureux, was 28. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Rosalie Mercier on 22 July 1823, in Saint-Pierre-les-Becquets, Nicolet, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 9 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 28 May 1882, in Windsor, Richmond, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 85, and was buried in Windsor, Richmond, Quebec, Canada.
