1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LZLZ-GW2
2 CONT Brief Life History of Joseph'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Joseph Pineau was born on 9 May 1820, in Saint-Germain-de-Rimouski, Rimouski, Quebec, Canada, his father, Anselme Pineau, was 29 and his mother, Ursule Côté, was 29. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Christine Cassista Bracelet on 16 February 1841. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 2 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 9 April 1850, in his hometown, at the age of 29, and was buried in Saint-Germain-de-Rimouski, Rimouski, Quebec, Canada.
