1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://www.ancestry.com/family-tree/person/tree/200217/person/-2004772703 Ancestry Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Apr 5 2020, 4:54:18 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT When Norbert Baril Barrie was born on February 15, 1829, his father, Jean, was 36 and his mother, Genevieve, was 35. He married Marie-Adelaide Delia Brule on October 23, 1854, in St-Cuthbert, Quebec, Canada. They had eight childre
2 CONC n in 18 years. He died on October 27, 1890, in Kankakee, Illinois, at the age of 61, and was buried in Bourbonnais, Illinois.
2 CONT
