2 CONT Louis (Petit Louis) BIBEAU was born on 26 Apr 1830 in St Pierre-de-Sorel, Richelieu, Quebec, Canada.  He was baptized on 26 Apr 1830 in St Pierre-de-Sorel, Richelieu, Quebec, Canada.  He appeared in the census in 1900 in Dayton, D
2 CONC ayton Township, Hennepin Country, Minnesota, USA.  He appeared in the census in 1910 in Dayton, Dayton Township, Hennepin Country, Minnesota, USA.  Entry under Bebeau Census on 6 May 1910
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis is living with his son, Paul
2 CONT
2 CONT Paul, head, 30 Mary, wife, 23 Alphonse, son, 2 Rose, daughter, 1 Louis, father, 80
2 CONT
2 CONT He died of Cystitis, with complications from an enlarged prostrate (illness for six months prior to death) on 7 Jan 1914 in Dayton, Dayton Township, Hennepin Country, Minnesota, USA.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was buried on 9 Jan 1914 in St Vincent-de-Paul, Osseo, Hennepin County, Minnesota, USA.
2 CONT
