1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/98G2-FDG
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Josephe'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Josephe Hus dite Lemoine was born on 7 July 1834, in Sorel-Tracy, Pierre-De Saurel, Quebec, Canada, her father, Augustin Hus Lemoine, was 33 and her mother, Marie Sophie Perrault, was 20. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Edouard Antaya dit Pelletier on 7 January 1852, in Saint-Pierre-de-Sorel, Pierre-De Saurel, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 10 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She lived in Sorel, Pierre-De Saurel, Quebec, Canada in 1871 and Sprague, New London, Connecticut, United States in 1880. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 29 January 1913, in Warwick, Kent, Rhode Island, United States, at the age of 78.
