2 CONT Brief Life History of Jean Baptiste'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Jean Baptiste Mignier dit Lagasse was born on 10 March 1808, in Saint-Hyacinthe, Saint-Hyacinthe, Quebec, Canada, his father, Augustin Mignier dit Lagacé, was 41 and his mother, Marie Pelagie Turcot, was 29. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 1st wife Adelaide Crete (1814-1889) on 14 October 1834, in Notre-Dame-du-Rosaire, Saint-Hyacinthe, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 2nd wife Delphine Brodeur dit Lavigne (1823–1896)
2 CONT on 15 Nov 1842 in Saint-Barnabé-Sud, Saint-Hyacinthe, Québec, Canada
2 CONT They had at least 10 children.
2 CONT [Note some children attributed to wife Adelaide in this listing may be duplicates of Delphine's children].
2 CONT
2 CONT He lived in Saint-Hyacinthe-le-Confesseur, Saint-Hyacinthe, Quebec, Canada in 1871 and Saint-Hyacinthe, Quebec, Canada in 1871. He died on 20 February 1885, in Weedon, Wolfe, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 76, and was buried in Wee
2 CONC don, Wolfe, Quebec, Canada.
