1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LHKD-BGP
2 CONT Brief Life History of Jean Baptiste'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Jean Baptiste Fortin was born on 14 November 1774, in Cap-Saint-Ignace, Montmagny, Quebec, Canada, his father, Joseph Romain Fortin, was 30 and his mother, Marie Louise Delisle, was 20. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Therese Rodrigue on 7 November 1808, in Cap-Saint-Ignace, Montmagny, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 5 daughters.
2 CONT Jean-Baptiste Fortin 1809–
2 CONT François Jérémie Fortin 1811–1865
2 CONT Hubert Fortin 1812–1845
2 CONT Marie Rosalie Fortin 1814–1814
2 CONT Marie Justine Fortin 1816–1885
2 CONT Julien Fortin 1818–1855
2 CONT Sophie Caroline Fortin 1819–1880
2 CONT Marie Julienne Fortin 1821–1910
2 CONT Paul Hyppolite Fortin 1825–1880
2 CONT Marie Basilice Fortin 1829–1835
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 27 December 1831, in L'Islet, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 57, and was buried in L'Islet, L'Islet, Quebec, Canada.
