1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/M1N3-4YS
2 CONT Brief Life History of Édouard'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Édouard Godin was born on 12 July 1812, in Cap-Santé, Portneuf, Quebec, Canada, his father, Paul Godin, was 33 and his mother, Françoise Godin, was 28. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marguerite Bédard on 2 February 1841, in Cap-Santé, Portneuf, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 3 daughters. 
2 CONT Marie Marcelline Godin 1841–
2 CONT Léa Godin /Gaudin 1843–1928
2 CONT Adelaide Godin 1844–1914
2 CONT Joseph Godin 1845–1932
2 CONT Onesime Godin 1846–1846 (died in infancy)
2 CONT Onesime Godin 1847–1847 (died in infancy)
2 CONT Emery Godin 1848–1916
2 CONT Felix Godin 1852–1891
2 CONT
2 CONT He lived in Saint-Basile, Portneuf, Quebec, Canada in 1871. He died on 11 March 1902, in Portneuf, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 89, and was buried in Portneuf, Quebec, Canada.
