0 @N6000000004975425894@ NOTE Notes for MARIE LAVALLEE (MARY LAVALLEY):
1 CONT Mary died sometime between the years of 1900 and 1904?  She was alive for the 1900 census and had died before 1904 the year that her husband died? 
1 CONT
1 CONT Note from Dave Brunner
1 CONT Found a Mary Fernette who died in Chippewa County on Jan. 25, 1901. Vol 1, Page 0439, Seq. # 104055.  She would have been 82 years old, she might be Peter Fernette's wife?
1 CONT
1 CONT Dale LaBonne checked with LaCrosse Archivist.  Mary Fernette, wife of Peter Fernette, died February 17, 1902.  Cause of death - Hip Fracture
